---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="AP Exam Preparation | Free Multiple Choice & FRQ Tips"
  description="Complete AP exam preparation guide with multiple choice and FRQ tips. Free download for AP students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>AP Exam<br><span>Preparation</span></h1>
    <p>Multiple choice and FRQ tips. Maximize your AP score with proven strategies.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Multiple Choice</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Strategy</h3>
        <pre><code>• 40% of total score
• No penalty for guessing
• Read all options before answering
• Eliminate obviously wrong answers
• Watch for "always" or "never"
• Check for trick questions</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Time Management</h3>
        <pre><code>• 55 questions in 55 minutes
• ~1 minute per question
• Don't spend too long on one question
• Mark and return to difficult questions
• Review answers if time permits</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Free Response Questions (FRQ)</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Strategy</h3>
        <pre><code>• 60% of total score
• Read all parts before answering
• Answer each part separately
• Show all working
• Use correct units
• Write in complete sentences</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Scoring</h3>
        <pre><code>• Partial credit awarded
• One point per correct step
• Don't leave anything blank
• Write something for every part
• Use correct terminology
• Be clear and organized</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Study Plan</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>8-Week Plan</h3>
        <pre><code>Week 1-2&#58; Review all topics
Week 3-4&#58; Focus on weak areas
Week 5-6&#58; Practice FRQs
Week 7&#58; Full practice exams
Week 8&#58; Final review and rest</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Daily Study</h3>
        <pre><code>• 1-2 hours per day
• Active recall practice
• Past paper questions
• Review mistakes
• Spaced repetition</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
